Lensfun lens correction database (unmodified copy)
===================================================

Content: the 55 XML files of the Lensfun database (cameras, mounts, lenses, calibrations), byte for byte as
shipped in the `db_files` folder of the lensfunpy 1.18.0 Python wheel (Lensfun library version 0.3.4.0).
They are the same files the Python Grainy loads. Nothing was added, removed or edited. The XML data only; no
Lensfun or lensfunpy program code is part of this folder.

